WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.842
Follow the three linked boxes. Sending invitations is an activity. A ready

00:00:03.842 --> 00:00:07.683
decision pack is an output. The intended outcome is a decision based

00:00:07.683 --> 00:00:11.525
on reliable information.

00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:15.167
The input-owner cards make responsibility visible. An agreed deadline and a controlled

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:18.600
document reference are more useful than assuming that somebody will send the

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.033
paper.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:25.967
At the review point, check the pack against the agreed requirements. A

00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:29.667
missing approval or paper remains an open gap. Do not describe the

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:33.367
pack as ready because invitations were sent.
